e":"Content-Length","value":"40"},{"name":"uid","value":"1008586744"},{"name":"Authorization","value":"Bearer MY_CuQAmVmChGUoo8IxHfPM0l0DxJRqfd6a8lvIA5sY.IMsqvMaY8S__kHxj-sKhHBkDi0gkrAhJB8YLqBOp_-k"},{"name":"content-type","value":"application\/json"},{"name":"user_token","value":"MY_CuQAmVmChGUoo8IxHfPM0l0DxJRqfd6a8lvIA5sY.IMsqvMaY8S__kHxj-sKhHBkDi0gkrAhJB8YLqBOp_-k"},{"name":"client","value":"6f1be101b3f7128cab2ec91466c2001a"},{"name":"platform","value":"1"},{"name":"Accept-Encoding","value":"gzip,compress,br,deflate"},{"name":"User-Agent","value":"Mozilla\/5.0 (iPhone; CPU iPhone OS 27_0_1 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit\/605.1.15 (KHTML, like Gecko) Mobile\/15E148 MicroMessenger\/8.0.80(0x18005041) NetType\/WIFI Language\/zh_CN"},{"name":"Referer","value":"https:\/\/servicewechat.com\/wx2122a51d44658e18\/564\/page-frame.html"}],"queryString":[],"httpVersion":"HTTP\/1.1","url":"https:\/\/mini-prog-wt-pro.singworld.net\/api\/theme\/getNearShopActList"},"response":{"status":200,"bodySize":20890,"content":{"text":"{\"success\":true,\"code\":0,\"msg\":\"\",\"data\":{\"pageNum\":1,\"pageSize\":10,\"size\":0,\"startRow\":0,\"endRow\":0,\"total\":202,\"pages\":21,\"list\":[{\"id\":848,\"name\":\"合肥NDU竞速试点赛\",\"showDesc\":0,\"themeDesc\":\"合肥e舞竞速试点赛活动方案\\r\\n\\r\\n一、赛事基本信息\\r\\n\\r\\n• 决赛时间：11月28日（26日停止初赛审核）\\r\\n\\r\\n• 比赛地点：潮玩派对（天鹅湖万达店）\\r\\n\\r\\n• 决赛机台：e舞2025\\r\\n\\r\\n• 报名方式：通过舞推活动信息页，添加主理人微信，提交个人报名资料完成报名\\r\\n\\r\\n二、竞赛赛制\\r\\n\\r\\n预赛\\r\\n\\r\\n1. 指定比赛曲目共2首（难度8‑9星）：\\r\\n①8星《honey》‑王心凌\\r\\n②9星《雨道》‑Otokaze\\r\\n\\r\\n2. 选手可选择e舞升级版或2025机台进行比赛，两首指定曲目均需完整完成。\\r\\n\\r\\n3. 参赛要求：预赛需采用全步伐；每出现1处步伐错误，记额外2个miss。\\r\\n\\r\\n4. 成绩提交：参赛全程录制视频，视频内需清晰展示游戏结算界面；每首曲目视频须全程录制，不可进行剪辑，确保全程脚步与屏幕均被录制，最终结算成绩分数清晰可见。需同步提交舞推平台成绩截图，视频与截图一并上交，提交后成绩不予修改。两首曲目均提交后视为完成参加预赛。\\r\\n\\r\\n5. 晋级规则：预赛总分排名前8名晋级决赛；决赛前一天公布晋级名单。若出现选手退赛情况，后续名次依次递补。\\r\\n\\r\\n决赛：（见图片）\",\"beginTime\":\"2026-11-28 14:29:00\",\"endTime\":\"2026-11-28 18:29:00\",\"applyDeadline\":\"2026-11-28 18:29:00\",\"dayCount\":0,\"sameCount\":0,\"visitCount\":0,\"visitNum\":\"1035\",\"optionCount\":0,\"createTime\":\"2026-11-09 13:37:02\",\"updateTime\":\"2026-11-09 13:37:02\",\"status\":3,\"imageUrl\":\"https:\/\/wt-media-pro.singworld.cn\/upload_wt_1640917888704_625060_Oj6USe6DxMAVbb33b7915215fa1670264169fd338d63.jpg\",\"voteCount\":0,\"personCount\":31,\"uid\":1087115400,\"themeType\":3,\"topFlag\":0,\"voted\":false,\"imageUrl2\":\"https:\/\/wt-media-pro.singworld.cn\/upload_wt_1640917888704_625060_Oj6USe6DxMAVbb33b7915215fa1670264169fd338d63.jpg\",\"rstImageUrl\":\"https:\/\/wt-media-pro.singworld.cn\/upload_wt_1640917888704_625060_Oj6USe6DxMAVbb33b7915215fa1670264169fd338d63.jpg\",\"recommendNum\":0,\"actShopList\":[1002761],\"actShopInfo\":[{\"id\":1002761,\"name\":\"潮玩派对\"}],\"actSongList\":[],\"actSongNum\":0,\"actModeList\":[],\"actUid\":1087115400,\"gameWeight\":100,\"normalWeight\":0,\"judgeWeight\":0,\"judgeList\":[],\"actType\":2,\"isUp\":0,\"actOnlineType\":1,\"actIsNew\":1,\"cityName\":\"合肥市\",\"redeemNum\":0,\"redeemTotalNum\":0,\"actCreateType\":1,\"eventRuleImgList\":[\"https:\/\/wt-media-pro.singworld.cn\/wt\/1087115400\/upload_wt_1087115400_1794198820321_tmp_9abccdf8fc8bb2dbca856acbb0cfb8f9.jpg?imageView2\/0\/h\/750\",\"https:\/\/wt-media-pro.singworld.cn\/wt\/1087115400\/upload_wt_1087115400_1794198820324_tmp_b1c6f9018af69575cd994359e6dc0e3f.jpg?imageView2\/0\/h\/750\",\"https:\/\/wt-media-pro.singworld.cn\/wt\/1087115400\/upload_wt_1087115400_1794198929660_tmp_8ffe98fd80bd8e427bf007dae01fec65.jpg?imageView2\/0\/h\/750\"],\"meter\":101000,\"isWpl\":0,\"activityType\":1},{\"id\":849,\"name\":\"iO电动工坊竞速线下比赛\",\"showDesc\":0,\"themeDesc\":\"扫码添加主理人微信加群报名。\\n报名并参赛即可获得两个称号。\\n本次比赛发放的称号由洛阳NDU主理人小辰和武汉NDU主理人柚子联名推出。\",\"beginTime\":\"2026-12-06 14:00:00\",\"endTime\":\"2026-12-06 18:30:00\",\"applyDeadline\":\"2026-12-06 18:30:00\",\"dayCount\":0,\"sameCount\":0,\"visitCount\":0,\"visitNum\":\"301\",\"optionCount\":0,\"createTime\":\"2026-11-17 16:37:57\",\"updateTime\":\"2026-11-17 16:37:57\",\"status\":3,\"imageUrl\":\"https:\/\/wt-media-pro.singworld.cn\/wt\/1064913359\/upload_wt_1064913359_1794822120433_tmp_6e1c39ed224075c620ed43334c680ac2.jpg\",\"voteCount\":0,\"personCount\":11,\"uid\":1064913359,\"themeType\":3,\"topFlag\":0,\"voted\":false,\"imageUrl2\":\"https:\/\/wt-media-pro.singworld.cn\/wt\/1064913359\/upload_wt_1064913359_1794822120433_tmp_6e1c39ed224075c620ed43334c680ac2.jpg\",\"rstImageUrl\":\"https:\/\/wt-media-pro.singworld.cn\/wt\/1064913359\/upload_wt_1064913359_1794822120433_tmp_6e1c39ed224075c620ed43334c680ac2.jpg\",\"recommendNum\":0,\"actShopList\":[1000393],\"actShopInfo\":[{\"id\":1000393,\"name\":\"iO电动工坊\"}],\"actSongList\":[],\"actSongNum\":0,\"actModeList\":[],\"actUid\":1064913359,\"gameWeight\":100,\"normalWeight\":0,\"judgeWeight\":0,\"judgeList\":[],\"actType\":2,\"isUp\":0,\"actOnlineType\":1,\"actIsNew\":1,\"cityName\":\"洛阳市\",\"redeemNum\":0,\"redeemTotalNum\":0,\"actCreateType\":1,\"eventRuleImgList\":[\"https:\/\/wt-media-pro.singworld.cn\/wt\/1064913359\/upload_wt_1064913359_1794822229787_tmp_f1ada8bad1d33e708d7ec1947f6cc8cc.jpg?imageView2\/0\/h\/750\"],\"meter\":101000,\"isWpl\":0,\"activityType\":1},{\"id\":851,\"name\":\"炫动四方电玩城竞速线下比赛\",\"showDesc\":0,\"themeDesc\":\"28日活动现场，精美称号？送！\\n现场三台相机，多角度直拍，只为记录最好的你！\\n竞速现金赛同天也火热开打，超多奖励到现场就有机会拿走！\\n去不了线下也想要称号怎么办，可以查看p7，所有赞助金额将放进选手奖池！\\n心动不如行动，扫描图中二维码了解详情\\n加18646013605也可以报名参赛\",\"beginTime\":\"2026-11-28 12:00:00\",\"endTime\":\"2026-11-28 18:00:00\",\"applyDeadline\":\"2026-11-28 18:00:00\",\"dayCount\":0,\"sameCount\":0,\"visitCount\":0,\"visitNum\":\"214\",\"optionCount\":0,\"createTime\":\"2026-11-20 18:39:03\",\"updateTime\":\"2026-11-20 18:39:03\",\"status\":3,\"imageUrl\":\"https:\/\/wt-media-pro.singworld.cn\/wt\/1095092538\/upload_wt_1095092538_1795069345409_tmp_9dc66d21ac58fbcdd6e44723e536b102.jpg\",\"voteCount\":0,\"personCount\":9,\"uid\":1095092538,\"themeType\":3,\"topFlag\":0,\"voted\":false,\"imageUrl2\":\"https:\/\/wt-media-pro.singworld.cn\/wt\/1095092538\/upload_wt_1095092538_1795069345409_tmp_9dc66d21ac58fbcdd6e44723e536b102.jpg\",\"rstImageUrl\":\"https:\/\/wt-media-pro.singworld.cn\/wt\/1095092538\/upload_wt_1095092538_1795069345409_tmp_9dc66d21ac58fbcdd6e44723e536b102.jpg\",\"recommendNum\":0,\"actShopList\":[1000027],\"actShopInfo\":[{\"id\":1000027,\"name\":\"炫动四方电玩城\"}],\"actSongList\":[],\"actSongNum\":0,\"actModeList\":[],\"actUid\":1095092538,\"gameWeight\":100,\"normalWeight\":0,\"judgeWeight\":0,\"judgeList\":[],\"actType\":2,\"isUp\":0,\"actOnlineType\":1,\"actIsNew\":1,\"cityName\":\"长春市\",\"redeemNum\":0,\"redeemTotalNum\":0,\"actCreateType\":1,\"eventRuleImgList\":[\"https:\/\/wt-media-pro.singworld.cn\/wt\/1095092538\/upload_wt_1095092538_1795069481658_tmp_93438adae22c3f2025027df0e337d8e3.jpg?imageView2\/0\/h\/750\",\"https:\/\/wt-media-pro.singworld.cn\/wt\/1095092538\/upload_wt_1095092538_1795069491718_tmp_2caf2b4da963f7678437a4fce9622010.jpg?imageView2\/0\/h\/750\",\"https:\/\/wt-media-pro.singworld.cn\/wt\/1095092538\/upload_wt_1095092538_1795069491717_tmp_5182deb85f8b455f81d77beb954c39c8.jpg?imageView2\/0\/h\/750\",\"https:\/\/wt-media-pro.singworld.cn\/wt\/1095092538\/upload_wt_1095092538_1795069491719_tmp_56e7f32678fb895757148de894f9ce15.jpg?imageView2\/0\/h\/750\"],\"meter\":101000,\"isWpl\":0,\"activityType\":1},{\"id\":786,\"name\":\"superbudd竞速线下比赛\",\"showDesc\":0,\"themeDesc\":\"活动主负责人：涵涵\\n杭州亚奥超级乐园魔王踢馆活动\\n所有爱玩竞速萌新大佬们有福咯\\n本次活动场地为超级乐园亚奥万象天地店\\n地址：杭州市萧山区亚奥万象天地三楼超级乐园（地铁6号线直达）\\n机台为E舞成名2025\\n守馆人（涵涵）\\n活动时间本周六（4月4号）下午14:00-营业结束\\n此次为踢馆活动欢迎大家来参加，本次增设萌新阶段，初入阶段，进阶阶段，大师阶段，传说阶段的踢馆难度根据rating值自由选择。踢馆歌曲为单曲或混音（单曲三局二胜制，混音一局定夺制）踢馆人二选一制。报名方式：现场线上都可\\n人数：活动期间内不限制人数\\n规则：单曲（踢馆人可自由选择两首歌曲第三首由被踢馆人选择）混音（由守馆方指定星级）\\n单曲难度分配（萌新阶段）rating值20以下：7-8\\n        （初入阶段）rating值20.01-27：9-10\\n        （进阶阶段）rating值27.01-33：10-11\\n        （大师阶段）rating值33.01-37.01：12-13\\n        （传说阶段）rating值37.01以上：14-16\\n混音难度分配（萌新阶段）ring值20以下：8-9星\",\"beginTime\":\"2026-04-04 14:00:00\",\"endTime\":\"2026-04-04 21:30:00\",\"ap